### 1. CREATE NOTICE (POST)
POST http://localhost:8081/notices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Exam Notice",
  "description": "End semester exam tomorrow"
}

### 2. READ ALL NOTICES (GET)
GET http://localhost:8081/notices

### 3. UPDATE NOTICE (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8081/notices/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Exam Notice",
  "description": "Exam postponed to next week"
}

### 4. DELETE NOTICE (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/notices/4

### 5. READ AGAIN (VERIFY DELETE)
GET http://localhost:8081/notices
